WEBVTT

00:03:29.496 --> 00:03:32.371
and they shouldn’t expect
themselves to just get over it

00:03:32.413 --> 00:03:35.704
anymore than they could will themselves
to get over a broken arm.

00:03:35.746 --> 00:03:37.954
If you haven't experienced
depression yourself,

00:03:37.996 --> 00:03:41.121
avoid comparing it to times
you've felt down.

00:03:41.163 --> 00:03:44.746
Comparing what they're experiencing
to normal, temporary feelings of sadness

00:03:44.788 --> 00:03:48.246
can make them feel guilty for struggling.

00:03:48.329 --> 00:03:51.954
Even just talking about
depression openly can help.

00:03:51.996 --> 00:03:55.538
For example, research shows that asking
someone about suicidal thoughts

00:03:55.579 --> 00:03:58.913
actually reduces their suicide risk.

00:03:59.038 --> 00:04:03.246
Open conversations about mental
illness help erode stigma